{"applicationId":"fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213","applicationName":"中交路南-出差考勤管理","content":"(function () {\r\n    //获取当前用户\r\n    var user = $.context.getCurrentUserId();\r\n    //应用Id\r\n    var applicationId = $.context.getCurrentApplicationId();\r\n\r\n    //获取本月度\r\n    var now = $.date.getCurrentDate();        //当前日期            \r\n    var nowYear = now.getYear() + 1900;\r\n    var yearstartdate = new Date(nowYear, 0, 1);   //本年第一天\r\n    var yearenddate = new Date(nowYear, 11, 31);  //本年最后一天\r\n\r\n    var date = yearstartdate.getTime();\r\n    var date1 = yearenddate.getTime();\r\n\r\n    //表单名称\r\n    var formName1 = \"员工信息维护\";\r\n    //控件值键对\r\n    var filterParamList1 = new Packages.java.util.ArrayList();\r\n    var filterParam1 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"姓名\", \"eq\", user);\r\n    // var filterParam2 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"休假类型\", \"eq\", \"1\");//\r\n    var filterParam3 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"申请日期\", \"ge\", date);//大于等于\r\n    var filterParam4 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"申请日期\", \"lt\", date1);//小于\r\n    filterParamList1.add(filterParam1);\r\n    // filterParamList.add(filterParam2);\r\n    filterParamList1.add(filterParam3);\r\n    filterParamList1.add(filterParam4);\r\n    var docS1 = $.form.getDocumentsByFilterParam(applicationId, formName1, filterParamList1);\r\n    if (docS1 != null && docS1.size() > 0) {\r\n        var kexiu = docS1.get(0).getElementByName(\"剩余年假\").getValue();\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    //表单名称\r\n    var formName = \"请假审批单\";\r\n    //控件值键对\r\n    var filterParamList = new Packages.java.util.ArrayList();\r\n    var filterParam1 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"姓名\", \"eq\", user);\r\n    var filterParam2 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"休假类型\", \"eq\", \"1\");//\r\n    var filterParam3 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"申请日期\", \"ge\", date);//大于等于\r\n    var filterParam4 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"申请日期\", \"lt\", date1);//小于\r\n    filterParamList.add(filterParam1);\r\n    filterParamList.add(filterParam2);\r\n    filterParamList.add(filterParam3);\r\n    filterParamList.add(filterParam4);\r\n    var docS = $.form.getDocumentsByFilterParam(applicationId, formName, filterParamList);\r\n    // $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"token\", num, $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n\r\n    var num = 0;\r\n    if (docS != null && docS.size() > 0) {\r\n        docS1.get(0).addElement(\"剩余年假天数\", String(kexiu));\r\n        // $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"111\", age, $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n        $.form.saveFormDocument(docS1.get(0), applicationId);\r\n        // $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"token\", num, $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n\r\n})()","createTime":1765854149000,"createUserId":"1889706623013949441","customJsId":"","definitionId":"","hiddenCode":"fc8d092d9a6546d88050368c2e7df1f2","id":"d4cd341be2b44568abddd7b2eee8af98","modelCode":"","modelId":"aba553fbf6a34c92bf342fd16aaff1bd","modelType":"FORM_DESIGN","namespace":"111","path":"请假审批单","status":"NORMAL","tenantId":"9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e","updateTime":1765854149000,"versions":0.0}